Definitions

"The Software" means everything in this repository: the code, the effects, the
caption animations, the setup files, the instructions and the documentation, in
original or modified form, in whole or in part.

"Official sources" means https://github.com/aiwithkristina/ai-video-studio and
https://aiwithkristina.com.

1. What you may do

You may download the Software from the official sources, install it on your own
computers, and use it to create any content for any purpose, including commercial
